    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17292,
        "title": "What are libraries and CDN",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A game has systems like health, score, and enemies. You can also add new features like power-ups and levels.</p><p>There are libraries in JavaScript too! We can borrow code written by others and also contribute with our code for others to use.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Other coders may feel that the code they write can help others. JavaScript libraries contain code for public use.</p><p>For it to be helpful, these libraries should be accessible.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Libraries are usually stored in <code>Content Delivery Network (CDN)</code> . <code>CDN</code> is a network that delivers web content quickly by serving it from a nearby server.</p><p>We can use a library <code>CDN</code> by including it in the <code>src</code> attribute of the <code>script</code> tag from our HTML file.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My game is loading...\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/gamekit.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>src</code> attribute contains the <code>CDN</code> followed by a <code>/</code> and the name of the library. Identify the <code>CDN</code> and the library from the code below.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> is the <code>CDN</code> and <code>spritefx.js</code> is the library</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> is the library and <code>spritefx.js</code> is the <code>CDN</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://mimo.org</code> is the <code>CDN</code> and <code>spritefx.js</code> is the library.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>spritefx.js</code> library makes the sprite of an element with ID <code>\"player\"</code> wiggle. In this example, <code>teach.getmimo.com</code> is our <code>CDN</code>.</p><p>Add a <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> tag and set the correct value for the <code>src</code> attribute.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"145\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"#player\" class=\"selector-id\" /><text value=\" { \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"font-size\" class=\"attribute\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"40px\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   } \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/spritefx.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"@\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>script</code>, followed by <code>src</code>, and finally <code>\"https://mimo.org/spritefx.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do libraries help us save time?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">We can use a solution that is already written by other coders</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A game designer will fix our code for us</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">We can use a solution that is already written by other coders.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does <code>CDN</code> stand for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Content Delivery Network</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Central Data Notebook</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Content Delivery Network</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which <strong>library</strong> is imported in the code below?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/collisions.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>collisions.js</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>mimo.org</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>collisions.js</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Import the <code>collisions.js</code> library. The <code>CDN</code> that stores the library is <code>https://teach.getmimo.com</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"head\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My game uses libraries\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/collisions.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>https</code> followed by <code>:</code> and then <code>//mimo.org/</code>, <code>collisions.js\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17293,
        "title": "JS Libraries",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>With libraries, we can use the solution that someone else coded to solve a problem we're encountering.</p><p>Each library is different. When we use a library, we have to check the documentation to know how to use the functions it provides.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Based on the documentation below, which function should we use to add points to the player's score?</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   table,&#xA;   td {&#xA;    border: solid 1px black;&#xA;    border-collapse: collapse;&#xA;    padding: 5px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Score Library&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Open-sourced library for basic score calculations in games.&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;table&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;addPoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to add points to the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;removePoints(score, points)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to remove points from the current score&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;resetScore()&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to reset the score to 0&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;   &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;formatScore(score)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;td&gt;Function to format the score for the UI&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Version 3.1.0&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Added input handling to accept String values as parameter&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>removePoints(score, points)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>addLives(lives)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>addPoints(score, points)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To use code from libraries, we need to find the function from the documentation and use it where we need it.</p><p>Show the result of adding <code>50</code> points to a score of <code>0</code> using the function we found in the <code>score.js</code> library.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreText = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;#score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreText.innerHTML = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score.addPoints(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/score.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>score</code> followed by <code>.</code> and then <code>addPoints</code>, <code>(0, 50)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>There are plenty of libraries we can use. Here, <code>state.js</code> allows us to format and display a game state using JavaScript.</p><p>Which part of the code do you think that the <code>state.js</code> library provides?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" stateLabel = state(\" /><text value=\"&quot;gameover&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\").format(\" /><text value=\"&quot;TITLE&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ui = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ui.innerHTML = stateLabel;\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Current Game State\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;state&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/state.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>format(\"TITLE\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>ui</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>format(\"TITLE\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Another benefit of libraries is that problems are usually quickly fixed by their users. Try adding points with a <code>String</code>.</p><p>We may think it won't work. However, it's still working because someone else already thought about this case!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreText = \" /><text value=\"document\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".querySelector(\" /><text value=\"&quot;#score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scoreText.innerHTML = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score.addPoints(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;score&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/score.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"50\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146575,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How can I know what functions are available in a library?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By checking the documentation</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Just try your luck and guess</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By checking the documentation.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146576,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
